WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.564
Euclid printed in

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:01.894
red

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:03.133
yellow and blue

00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:04.892
Open any edition

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:05.753
of Euclid printed

00:00:05.564 --> 00:00:07.262
between fourteen eighty-two

00:00:07.086 --> 00:00:08.583
and eighteen forty-six

00:00:08.689 --> 00:00:09.267
and you meet

00:00:09.079 --> 00:00:10.198
the same sentence

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.024
thousands of times

00:00:10.836 --> 00:00:11.389
over

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:13.364
Oliver Byrne's eighteen

00:00:13.176 --> 00:00:14.343
forty-seven edition

00:00:14.155 --> 00:00:14.992
changed that

00:00:15.145 --> 00:00:16.171
the triangle has

00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:16.961
no letters on

00:00:16.773 --> 00:00:17.161
it

00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:18.341
one side red

00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:19.308
one yellow

00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:20.145
one blue

00:00:20.678 --> 00:00:21.550
Byrne was born

00:00:21.362 --> 00:00:22.340
in eighteen ten

00:00:22.152 --> 00:00:23.178
in County Wicklow

00:00:23.225 --> 00:00:24.015
and his book

00:00:23.827 --> 00:00:25.041
taught geometry as

00:00:24.853 --> 00:00:25.571
pictures

00:00:25.631 --> 00:00:26.196
not as a

00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:27.305
spelling exercise

00:00:27.822 --> 00:00:28.836
Full story on

00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:29.543
the dashboard
